# Documentation discipline

- Documentation must be factual and traceable to code/DDL.
- When docs describe a module or endpoint, it must match current code.
- Update docs/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md when run/build steps change.
- Keep docs concise: no marketing text, only technical facts and steps.
